# Preview links

After any visual change (UI, layout, CSS, canvas, public assets, or anything the user can see in the browser), include the live preview URL in the wrap-up. Do not wait to be asked.

- Prefer the Vercel Preview URL from the PR — the stable `*-git-*.vercel.app` alias in Vercel’s GitHub comment, or the `environment_url` on the Preview deployment.
- Also include the PR URL.
- Do not substitute the Vercel dashboard inspect URL for the actual site.
- If the preview is still deploying, say so and post the URL as soon as it is Ready.
- If there is no PR yet, open one so a preview exists, then share that URL.
